<title>USA: Gucci shares gain after rating upgraded.</title>
<headline>Gucci shares gain after rating upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of luxury goods maker Gucci Group NV gained 2-3/4 to 69 after Morgan Stanley raised its rating on the stock to a strong buy from outperform.</p>
</text>
